{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Abu Dawud","name_native":"Sünen-i Ebu Davud","section":{"2":"Prayer (Kitab Al-Salat)"},"section_detail":{"2":{"hadithnumber_first":391,"hadithnumber_last":1160,"arabicnumber_first":391,"arabicnumber_last":1160,"name_native":"Namaz Kitabı"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":765,"arabicnumber":765,"text":"Cubeyr b. Mut'im'den; \"Ben Nebi (Sallallahu aleyhi ve Sellem)'i nafile namaz konusunda beyanda bulunurken dinledim\" demiş sonra da bir önceki (764.) hadiste geçen dua'nın benzerini zikretmiştir. Ebu Davud rivayet etmiştir","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Muhammad Muhyi Al-Din Abdul Hamid","grade":"Daif"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Hasan Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Hasan"}],"reference":{"book":2,"hadith":375}}]}